WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.343
Everyone in Ed's family is a clown.

2
00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:07.987
Ed's grandfather is a clown.

3
00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:09.999
Ed's father is a clown.

4
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.829
Ed's mother is a clown.

5
00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.510
Ed wants to be a clown too.

6
00:00:17.511 --> 00:00:19.994
Now Ed is seven years old.

7
00:00:19.995 --> 00:00:24.773
He is going to clown school.

8
00:00:24.774 --> 00:00:29.752
"Ed, here's your school uniform," says his mother.

9
00:00:29.753 --> 00:00:31.671
Ed looks at his uniform.

10
00:00:31.672 --> 00:00:35.589
He is very surprised.

11
00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.472
The coat is too long.

12
00:00:37.473 --> 00:00:40.671
The pants are too short.

13
00:00:40.672 --> 00:00:43.243
The shoes are too big.

14
00:00:43.244 --> 00:00:47.955
The hat is too small.

15
00:00:47.956 --> 00:00:53.207
"Mom! My uniform doesn't fit," Ed says.

16
00:00:53.208 --> 00:00:57.069
Ed's mother looks at the clothes.

17
00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:59.290
"Everything is perfect.

18
00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:03.756
Let me help you," she says and smiles.

19
00:01:03.757 --> 00:01:06.646
"There you are, dear."

20
00:01:06.647 --> 00:01:08.596
She paints his face.

21
00:01:08.597 --> 00:01:11.581
His mouth is bigger.

22
00:01:11.582 --> 00:01:14.638
"Here is a tear under your eye.

23
00:01:14.639 --> 00:01:16.978
Here is a red nose.

24
00:01:16.979 --> 00:01:22.707
Here is a funny hat," says his mother.

25
00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:24.501
Ed looks in the mirror.

26
00:01:24.502 --> 00:01:27.857
He is very happy.

27
00:01:27.858 --> 00:01:31.396
"Am I a clown?" he asks.

28
00:01:31.397 --> 00:01:34.024
"No," says his mother.

29
00:01:34.025 --> 00:01:37.806
"You just look like a clown!"

30
00:01:37.807 --> 00:01:41.124
Ed walks to clown school with two smiles.

31
00:01:41.125 --> 00:01:42.990
One smile is painted.

32
00:01:42.991 --> 00:01:47.881
And one smile is real.

